{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38697","headline":"投谢钱武肃 · 吴仁璧","name":"投谢钱武肃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东门上相好知音，数尽台前郭隗金。\n累重虽然容食椹，力微无计报焚林。\n弊貂不称芙蓉幕，衰朽仍惭玳瑁簪。\n十里溪光一山月，可堪从此负归心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴仁璧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}